{
  "name": "Check and enrich Facebook lead ad signups, then send them to HubSpot and a nurture campaign",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Check and enrich Facebook lead ad signups, then send them to HubSpot and a nurture campaign\n\n### How it works\nClean leads from ads before anyone calls them. The Facebook Lead Ads Trigger fires for each new lead on your form. Argorant checks the email right away. A valid address is enriched with title and company, upserted in HubSpot with name, job title and company, and added to your nurture campaign. Any other result (invalid, risky, catch-all or unknown) is upserted in HubSpot with lead status Unqualified and the check result, so your team can review it, and is not added.\n\nCosts: half a credit per fresh check; 1 credit when enrichment finds the person. Adding to the campaign is free.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Add a Facebook Lead Ads credential and pick the page and form in **New lead ad signup**.\n4. Add a HubSpot App Token credential to both HubSpot nodes.\n5. Pick the campaign in **Add to nurture campaign** and activate.\n\n### Customization\nMap more form questions into HubSpot properties, or alert sales in team chat for senior titles.",
        "height": 670,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "02e2ad3a-0ca8-4126-acf2-0623c880d4c2",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -360
